o every issue page logs a console error.\n- Start work at low risk runs `wtx go`, which always starts the agent in plan mode. wtx has `brief --build` but no `go --build`.\n\n\n- **Gates:** a status PATCH or a board drag into in-review skips the checks' gate. That follows the PRD's floor rule, but steps 5 and 6 don't yet show the note when the checks aren't proven at the head. `GET /api/issues/{id}/tests` already answers `gate.proven` and `gate.reason`.\n- **Sign-off:** the criteria gate exists only in the browser, not on the server.\n- **ADR 0001:**\n  - pushing and fetching `refs/notes/ci/*` with sync;\n  - the feedback run in the live worktree;\n  - ssh-agent keys and literal `key::` signing keys, which are refused today;\n  - pruning the `refs/notes/ci-tmp/*` refs a crash leaves behind.\n- **AI:** `[ai] model` in the toml, and a Settings › AI page.\n- **Step 3:**\n  - plan versions: v1/v2, changes since v1, Edit;\n  - structural plans on a `plan/` branch PR;\n  - with `plans-in-pr = false`, the PR waits until step 5.\n- **Step 5:** per-commit +/- stats, and an \"open the agent\" link.\n- **Step 6:** \"against plan v2: k of n steps found\", and a bot tag on the aside's rows.\n- **Step 7:** a \"how\" line on a checked criterion.\n- **Wording:** \"Approved by \" with an empty login (`CyclePlan.vue:29`).\n- **900px:**\n  - the header's Inbox and Send overlap;\n  - the \"Updated just now\" toast covers step 4's Run button.\n- **wtx:** plain `wtx brief` (Revise) starts the planner on a new conversation. Whether it should resume, as `--build` does, is still open.\n\n\n- [ ] Each \"From the live run\" item is fixed, or has its own issue.\n- [ ] Each deferred item is built, has its own issue, or is dropped with a reason written here.\n- [ ] `make ci` passes."}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"11cf928817d9737c5df8ca59f7239819a80d5569","field":"status","value":"open"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386